{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/791883-corrupted-apotheosis","id":791883,"title":"Corrupted Apotheosis?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-23T18:14:19-08:00","id":791883,"title":"Corrupted Apotheosis?","content":"So throughout the books I've noticed several instances where Gods and Titans appear to just switch roles / identifications with each other. Some Titans end up allying themselves with the Gods or even becoming recognized as Gods and vice versa. Some of the more evil or mischievous Gods even become recognized as &quot;demons&quot; and other strange creatures.<br /> <br /> <br /> So what happens if a Scion under the control of a Titan achieves apotheosis? Do they become a corrupted God? Do they join the ranks of the Titans? Is it even possible for them to achieve this transformation without the consent of their Pantheon?<br /> <br /> Once they do become Gods, is it possible to transform into a Titan later in life, or for a Titan to redeem itself and become a recognized God?<br /> <br /> So many questions about what happens if an evil character tries to ascend to the ranks of the divine!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T18:26:10-08:00","id":791889,"title":"","content":"I'll just say that the &quot;Long Road to Heaven&quot; Cycle deals with exactly this idea. Not to spoil any more, but pretty much all your questions should be answered in that cycle one way or another.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-23T20:49:29-08:00","id":791947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/791883-corrupted-apotheosis?p=791889#post791889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll just say that the &quot;Long Road to Heaven&quot; Cycle deals with exactly this idea. Not to spoil any more, but pretty much all your questions should be answered in that cycle one way or another.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Ah, I own Hero and Demigod. Still waiting on God and Companion to be delivered. Hopefully they'll be here by Christmas. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T16:57:56-08:00","id":794468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/791883-corrupted-apotheosis?p=791889#post791889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll just say that the &quot;Long Road to Heaven&quot; Cycle deals with exactly this idea. Not to spoil any more, but pretty much all your questions should be answered in that cycle one way or another.</div> </div> </div> </div> what does this reference? I find several things titled this that do not seem related.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T19:32:30-08:00","id":794558,"title":"","content":"Long Road to Heaven is the name of the Campaing included in the Scion books both the name of the first adventure, and of the full Arc story","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4856-alfanumerico","name":"alfanumerico","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T03:46:14-08:00","id":794741,"title":"","content":"So yeah... ordered the books on the 15h and they still haven't arrived. A little pissed about that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Tracking says they should arrive tomorrow by the end of the day, though.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-30T11:00:59-08:00","id":796905,"title":"","content":"Woo! Finally arrived. Now to answer my questions!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T18:05:13-08:00","id":807477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/791883-corrupted-apotheosis?p=791889#post791889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll just say that the &quot;Long Road to Heaven&quot; Cycle deals with exactly this idea. Not to spoil any more, but pretty much all your questions should be answered in that cycle one way or another.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Okay, so I finally read the book and I'm still confused as to this.<br /> <br /> The book does state that one of the villains from TLRtH became an avatar, but it doesn't say how they did so. My best guess is that they were absorbed by the Titan, but I don't know if there's more to it than that.<br /> <br /> <br /> The book also didn't seem to explicitly detail how a Titan might become a God, it only suggested it as a possible story hook to focus on in future adventures.<br /> <br /> <br /> What I was asking about in the original post was if there are any specific rules for handling this, or if it's just a plot related transformation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T20:17:48-08:00","id":807549,"title":"","content":"I've looked through all of the books, too, and haven't seen any hard and fast rules about a Titan-Corrupted apotheosis. My best suggestion would be to leave it up to GM discretion.<br /> You could probably work out, character-wise, whether they should become a titan themselves or just an evil/corrupt God.<br /> As for mechanics, I recommend just following the same rules for apotheosis as any other scion, with effects leaning toward their corruption.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10163-toomuchjesus","name":"Toomuchjesus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T05:56:48-08:00","id":815380,"title":"","content":"Alright, so if there is no concrete rules on the subject, I've decided to house rule it as such.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> 1: if a Scion serves the Titans, their Apotheosis leads to them becoming an Avatar instead.<br /> <br /> 2: Prior to their ascension, the Scion bargains with the Greater Titan, deciding upon an aspect they wish to symbolize.<br /> <br /> 3: Once their decision is made, the Scion willfully allows the Titan to absorb them while undergoing apotheosis.<br /> <br /> 4: While being absorbed, their ascension is corrupted, turning the Scion into an avatar for the metaphysical Titan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}